        "content": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I've built a <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=denis-gorbachev.lean4-code-actions\">VSCode extension</a> to automate common actions on Lean code.</p>\n<p><strong>Supported commands:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Auto-import a definition (by far the greatest time-saver)</li>\n<li>Extract a definition to a separate file</li>\n<li>Create a new file with boilerplate code</li>\n<li>Set argument style</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DenisGorbachev/vscode-lean4-code-actions#commands\">+ 2 more</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Screencasts:</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/2Pu2DvWYlDHduhc_LW7nx8R5/autoImport.gif\">Auto-import</a></p>\n<div class=\"message_inline_image\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/2Pu2DvWYlDHduhc_LW7nx8R5/autoImport.gif\" title=\"Auto-import\"><img src=\"/user_uploads/3121/2Pu2DvWYlDHduhc_LW7nx8R5/autoImport.gif\"></a></div><p><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/C8j1-opW94wZ1Tqxoz7RUX6I/extractDefinitionToSeparateFile.gif\">Extract definition</a></p>\n<div class=\"message_inline_image\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/C8j1-opW94wZ1Tqxoz7RUX6I/extractDefinitionToSeparateFile.gif\" title=\"Extract definition\"><img src=\"/user_uploads/3121/C8j1-opW94wZ1Tqxoz7RUX6I/extractDefinitionToSeparateFile.gif\"></a></div><p><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/HkGQLxWk5etdH6gZMWaTk9bj/createNewFile.gif\">Create new file</a></p>\n<div class=\"message_inline_image\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/HkGQLxWk5etdH6gZMWaTk9bj/createNewFile.gif\" title=\"Create new file\"><img src=\"/user_uploads/3121/HkGQLxWk5etdH6gZMWaTk9bj/createNewFile.gif\"></a></div><p><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/KBvZB8KCXR4bXiq6sNPO_lXu/setArgumentStyle.gif\">Set argument style</a></p>\n<div class=\"message_inline_image\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/KBvZB8KCXR4bXiq6sNPO_lXu/setArgumentStyle.gif\" title=\"Set argument style\"><img src=\"/user_uploads/3121/KBvZB8KCXR4bXiq6sNPO_lXu/setArgumentStyle.gif\"></a></div><p><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/fvnWXAQZ8WVpM7wRGavdFYAZ/rename.gif\">Rename</a></p>\n<div class=\"message_inline_image\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/fvnWXAQZ8WVpM7wRGavdFYAZ/rename.gif\" title=\"Rename\"><img src=\"/user_uploads/3121/fvnWXAQZ8WVpM7wRGavdFYAZ/rename.gif\"></a></div><p><strong>Links:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=denis-gorbachev.lean4-code-actions\">Install</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DenisGorbachev/vscode-lean4-code-actions#commands\">Docs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DenisGorbachev/vscode-lean4-code-actions/issues/new?template=bug_report.md\">Report a bug</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DenisGorbachev/vscode-lean4-code-actions/issues/new?template=feature_request.md\">Request a feature</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bug reports and feature requests are very welcome.</p>\n<p>P.S. Currently the extension operates on text, not on <code>Syntax</code>. Thus, it may work incorrectly in edge cases. If you're interested in upgrading it to <code>Syntax</code> version - let's collaborate!</p>",
        "id": 386974015,
        "sender_full_name": "Denis Gorbachev",
        "timestamp": 1692841771
